                                        <a href="https://calendly.com/itdgrowthlabs-info/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="js-book-call" data-source="blog_cta" style="background:#1565c0;color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;">Book Free 30-min Call</a>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is the best influencer tier for skincare D2C?</h3>
                                        <p>Micro (10-100K) is best ROI tier. Rs 3,000-30,000 per post + product. Niche audience alignment + high engagement + affordable at scale. 6-15 micro-collabs / month Growth-tier.</p>
                                        <h3>How much should we budget for skincare influencer marketing?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 1.5-6 lakh / month all-in Growth-tier (creator fees + product + rights + agency). Budget shape: 50% micro + 25% macro + 15% nano + 10% derm + celebrity.</p>
                                        <h3>Should we hire a dermatologist advisor?</h3>
                                        <p>Highly recommended for clinical + concern-led + serious brands. Rs 2-8 lakh / year retainer + monthly content collaboration. Derm partnership drives 40-60% higher conversion vs generic creator. Investment worth 2-3x higher fee.</p>
                                        <h3>Should we negotiate usage rights for creator content?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes always. 12-month usage across paid + organic + email + web + whitelisting + edit rights + global usage. 25-50% premium on base fee. Justified &mdash; creator content in paid outperforms studio content 20-40% CPL + 30-50% ROAS.</p>
                                        <h3>What is Meta Branded Content Partner (whitelisting)?</h3>
                                        <p>Ads run from creator handle + attributed to brand + tracked as paid conversion. 30-50% higher engagement + CTR + lower CPL. Requires creator to enable Branded Content Partner in Meta settings + tag brand as partner.</p>
                                        <h3>How do we source skincare creators?</h3>
                                        <p>Aspire + Grin + Meta Creator Marketplace + manual Instagram + LinkedIn (for derm) + referrals. 30-50 candidates &rarr; 15-25 vetting &rarr; 8-15 outreach &rarr; 4-8 booked. Vet: audience + engagement + brand-safety + prior skincare / beauty + authenticity.</p>
                                        <h3>What ROI should we expect from skincare influencer?</h3>
                                        <p>3-8x ROAS on amplification budget. 30-50% CPL reduction on retargeting using UGC. 20-45% engagement lift on organic feed. Derm content 40-60% higher conversion for clinical.</p>
                                        <h3>How does ITD GrowthLabs run skincare influencer programmes?</h3>
                                        <p>Casting + brief + rights + content review + Meta Branded Content Partner + amplification into paid + UGC library + derm partnership + celebrity + luxury (Enterprise). 20-40 posts / month Growth-tier. See <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php">skincare vertical page</a>.</p>
